ent to reflect the current supported keyboard-accessibility state of the audited flows.\n42\t- **Republish**: run both updated documents through the Red Hat docs content process to publication.\n43\t- Out of scope: conformance claims for flows outside the four audited ones, and screen-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard fixes delivered.\n44\t\n45\t## Acceptance Criteria\n46\t\n47\t- The VPAT's entries for the four audited flows reflect the implemented keyboard-operability and focus-indicator fixes, with no claims contradicting the delivered state.\n48\t- The product documentation accessibility statement is updated and republished to match.\n49\t- Both documents are technically reviewed against the implemented Dashboard fixes by the engineering team that delivered them, and review findings are addressed before publication.\n50\t- The updated VPAT and accessibility statement are published and live at their documented locations.\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- **HLR-3 (P2)**: The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed state, with technical review — this epic delivers that documentation in full.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f6cd2186fea345","agent_id":"a19cd0fe87b0ae337","session_id":"0d8c28b9-8702-4bae-9684-c8dd1bf6fab6","uuid":"72f3da1d-e64a-4362-b9e2-db739ed958fa","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:59:52.004Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a20b0e9a28226c56","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
